# Pairs with NoStrandedBucket. The terminal broadcast to the old copy is not
# mirrored into the resized copy while the resize forwards, so the buckets the
# mirrored prepares left there are never consumed.
MODULE: NoStrandedBucketTerminalNotMirrored
TARGET: NoStrandedBucket
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a terminal to the old copy is not mirrored, so the resized copy keeps the batch's buckets forever
PERTURBS: SagaTerminal

--- FIND
                  ELSE {<<target, s>>} \cup (IF ResizeMirrors(target, s) THEN {<<R, s>>} \cup TermClosure(s) ELSE {})
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the terminal is not shadow-forwarded.
                  ELSE {<<target, s>>}
--- END
